a.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/suin/items/316cb8aaf8dfcf11abae#restful%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E5%86%AA%E7%AD%89%E6%80%A7","original_url":"https://qiita.com/suin/items/316cb8aaf8dfcf11abae#restful%E3%81%AB%E3%81%8A%E3%81%91%E3%82%8B%E5%86%AA%E7%AD%89%E6%80%A7"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=6R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60d391bc-1b93-4d23-8c18-3f7944876906","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"Webアプリだと、多分先に必要なページにリダイレクトされるんだろうなぁ","ts":"1624860412.199600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Cx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11f1748d-a582-480a-b9b2-dd577533da99","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なんかWebアプリのURLの冪等性みたい \u0026gt; 「そのシーンを指定すればいきなり正しいアセットが読み込めて、ゲームも正しく初期化されてる」というのがいい","ts":"1624860317.198400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z2Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67e5544c-0367-4564-b259-154bdf837f85","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"アセットのロードか、なるほど?","ts":"1624860133.197600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RkY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81920556-47e9-4dbb-bd0b-351d6e3bb6a2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"シーンもその一種","ts":"1624860099.197300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rXyHa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6daadb4f-6844-4e93-ab38-f007bebe090d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分はいつも「あらゆるものが Update と Draw を持つ、引数は場合によって変わるので共通のインターフェイスはない」みたいなノリでやってます","ts":"1624860095.197100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1wJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb57173b-08ca-428f-88cc-00a38fa11fa3","type":"message","user":"U